<title>NEW ZEALAND: Affco full yr net profit slips slightly.</title>
<headline>Affco full yr net profit slips slightly.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   31.9 vs 33.6</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 13.0 vs 12.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  2.5 vs same</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		 5.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover				   889.5 vs 916.4</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     27.4 vs 23.9</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.58 vs 0.29</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		    loss 0.27 vs 0.65 profit</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 204.7 vs 123.3</p>
<p>Dividend carries no imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Jan 31</p>
<p>Reg date Jan 17</p>
<p>    Ex div   Jan 20</p>
<p>Note - Affco Holdings Ltd is a meat processor.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
